                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><div><span><strong>《医用工效学基础：数字化动作捕捉与负荷分析》</strong>是融合医学与工程的前沿交叉课程</span><span>。</span></div>
<div><span>本课程突破传统定性评估的局限，聚焦</span><strong>力学平台</strong><span>、<strong>表面肌电（sEMG）</strong></span><span>与</span><span><strong>惯性传感器（IMU）动作捕捉</strong>三大现代测量技术。</span><span>通过理论讲授与实操结合，学生将深入掌握多模态传感器数据融合及肌肉骨骼系统建模分析技能</span><span>。</span></div>
<div><span>课程旨在培养学生运用客观的数字生物力学指标，精准评估与解决</span><strong>职业健康</strong><span>、</span><strong>临床康复</strong><span>及<strong>人机交互</strong>中复杂工效学问题的识别、分析和综合研能力。</span></div></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height:70.8500pt;">
                <td width=205 valign=center colspan=4 style="width:123.1000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
